OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain in the morning across
OL,6,FShetland, heavy at times, but drier
OL,7,Fand brighter conditions soon reaching
OL,8,FOrkney. These drier and brighter
OL,9,Fconditions then pushing into Shetland
OL,10,Fin the afternoon with well scattered
OL,11,Fshowers.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FIt will be showery during
OL,14,Fthis evening and overnight, the
OL,15,Fshowers heavy and frequent at times.
OL,16,FWinds will strengthen from the
OL,17,Fsouthwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
