OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FBright spells and showers, the
OL,6,Fshowers heavy and frequent at times.
OL,7,FThe west or southwest winds will
OL,8,Fbecome strong to gale force across
OL,9,FOrkney, lighter and more variable in
OL,10,FShetland.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,13,Fwith showers and easing winds on
OL,14,FSaturday. Windy with heavy rain or
OL,15,Fshowers on Sunday. Further showers and
OL,16,Feasing winds on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
